{"id":"a59ae25080feef85","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-vopenka.md","title":"Vopěnka's Principle","display":"thm-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-vopenka","aliases":["58-thm-vopenka"],"display":"thm-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-vopenka"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-vopenka</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in V\">\\(L\\in V\\)</span> (set-sized first-order signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> (class parameter in the ambient class theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(-,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(-,L)\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\\)</span> are class-theoretic notions; the latter explicitly fixes the common language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> is Vopěnka's principle</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-df-class-embedding-data</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathcal A\">\\(\\forall\\mathcal A\\)</span> 为元语言类量词。四元嵌入关系在下式定义，不再作为未展开的原语。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists j\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\n\\land\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists j\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\n\\land\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The common signature is fixed, set-sized, and explicitly verified to be a first-order language.</li>\n<li>The existing three-place elementary-embedding atom existentially chooses a language internally, so it cannot guarantee elementarity in this displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>; the four-place metatheoretic relation fixes that semantic leak.</li>\n<li>In a first-order set theory, the displayed class quantification is represented by the corresponding axiom scheme over formulas defining <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>It is much stronger than the existence of a proper class of measurable cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(-,L)$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(-,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists j\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\n\\land\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,M,N;L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L).","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false}],"bytes":2509,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4481","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-vopenka.md|58-thm-vopenka]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["3888033a846b1cd5","d9b8711cda3f31ca","5578254565969219","a25c0a66cf56c0f4"]}